OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally, a fine and dry start
OL,6,Fto the day with the odd mist patch
OL,7,Fclearing rapidly. Cloud filling in
OL,8,Fthrough the day with a very isolated
OL,9,Fshower bubbling up in the west but
OL,10,Ffeeling pleasant in any sunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA fine and dry evening with
OL,13,Fsunny spells. Remaining mostly dry
OL,14,Fovernight but clouding over from the
OL,15,Fwest with the best of clear intervals
OL,16,Ftowards the coast. Muggy overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
