OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FCloudy to start with light
OL,6,Frain developing across the region
OL,7,Fduring the morning. This clears to the
OL,8,Feast leaving isolated showers but
OL,9,Fbecoming fine into the evening.
OL,10,FTemperatures around average.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FMostly dry and partly cloudy for the
OL,14,Fnext few days, although the odd light
OL,15,Fshower is possible. Feeling warm in
OL,16,Fthe sun and muggy by night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
